    "text": "Bold line under the warning of the Delete encryption key confirmation dialog in Profile > Keys management, naming the private rooms whose files the user can no longer open once their only encryption key is deleted. {{rooms}} is a comma-separated list of one or more room names, so keep the wording neutral in number.",
